Please note that you need to have PostgreSQL installed on your system and also the `postgresql` driver must be added to your classpath for this program to work.

**Note:** To use this program, you can replace `"localhost:5432/mydb"`, `"username"`, and `"password"` with your actual PostgreSQL database credentials and connection details.

